      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_7",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Now that we’re down off the hills, you can’t even see all that water, it’s hidden by the trees. I never thought I would see so many trees in one place."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Compared to the desert it seems almost like a paradise. All this growth and vegetation, I can feel it pulsing with life."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("And yet these trees seem different, the forest seems darker, somehow. I prefer to stay out in the open where I can see my enemies coming."),
          },
          {
            tag: "switch",
            variable: "ally_id",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Grog",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Grog",
                    text: _("Trees look big and strong, like trolls. Dark, too. Grog tired of walking under hot sun."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Nog",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Nog",
                    text: _("Trees look big and strong, like trolls. Dark, too. Nog tired of walking under hot sun."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Rogrimir",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Rogrimir",
                    text: _("It looks nice and dark under the trees, less exposed to that blazing sun. I’m exhausted after walking across all that harsh sand."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Jarl",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Jarl",
                    text: _("It looks nice and dark under the trees, less exposed to that blazing sun. I’m exhausted after walking across all that harsh sand."),
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("This is where the human encampments lie, to the northwest. They have settled a chain of islands along the coast of the water. If you break through these trees you will soon see them. I think that’s where they are holding the rest of my group."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("Our leader wanted to make sure that if one of us was captured, we couldn’t betray her location. So she didn’t tell us where she was, but she taught us a simple spell to divine her hiding place. But it requires three merfolk to cast. So in order to find her, we must rescue at least two of my people. Though I hope we can save all of them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("And you said that there are only five others in your group left?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("We originally numbered much more, but we were ambushed by a band of naga on the way here. Half of our force held off the naga while the rest of us fled. By the time we got to these shores, only six of us were left. But for the grace of the Sea God I managed to hide when the rest of my group was ambushed and captured. I doubt that they have been broken yet, but I do not know how long they can last. Remember, without three of us, you will not be able to find our leader."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            portrait: "portraits/nym_moody.webp",
            text: _("Wait, did you hear that?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Someone’s coming. Quick, hide!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("What? Huh?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 45,
            y: 38,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "scout1",
            type: "Spearman",
            side: 2,
            x: 44,
            y: 41,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "scout1",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "scout2",
            type: "Javelineer",
            side: 2,
            x: 46,
            y: 41,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "scout2",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hey, what do we have here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("Uh... Uh..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("It’s another one of those fish creatures. It must have come back to try to rescue its friends."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Ha, stupid creature. But we’re in luck, the Council was looking for the last of these spies."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We’d better get him back to the base. They’re going to sacrifice them all in some big holy ceremony at dawn just two days from now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Yeah, we’ll be heroes!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Not if we gut you first. Attack!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("The Dark Lady protect us, they’re elves!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("There’s tons of them! Flee, we must warn the others!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "scout1",
            x: 43,
            y: 37,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "scout2",
            x: 45,
            y: 37,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "scout1",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "scout2",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Well, so much for the element of surprise."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("Thank you. I’m sorry, I don’t know what came over me. They just jumped out of nowhere."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("It’s fine, you’re not used to being on dry ground, and you’ve been through a lot. Even if the humans know we’re coming, we can still take them. Just be careful and stay in the back until we reach the water again."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("I sure will look forward to that. I’m afraid my scales have all dried out again. It itches something terrible."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Well if we’re going to save those merfolk, then we don’t have any time to lose. The humans said they would be sacrificed in just two days. We’d better set up camp here and push on north west as soon as possible. I just hope we can make it in time."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Ke",
            cells: "44,45",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Ce",
            cells: "43,44;44,44;45,44;43,45;44,46;45,45",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_1",
            type: "Swordsman",
            side: 6,
            x: 27,
            y: 42,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_1",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_2",
            type: "Javelineer",
            side: 2,
            x: 33,
            y: 39,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
