          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Whoa, this water is warm. Imagine if we had this back home, more water than I could drink in a lifetime! Hey... wait a minute. Faugh! This water is salty! It tastes terrible, I can’t drink this! What use is all this water if you can’t drink it?"),
