      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_38",
        on: "human_retreat",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "enter_hekuba",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hekuba",
            text: _("Curse them! The elves have stolen our offering to the Lady. We will have our vengeance. Keep fighting and execute plan C!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to_unit",
            id: "Hekuba",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Hekuba",
            x: 16,
            y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Hekuba",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Who was that?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("That was one of the Iron Triad. Rarely do they leave their sanctuary. They prefer to let their minions do the dirty work."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_40",
        on: "branch_if_40",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "ally_race",
            equals: "dwarf",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Wait, my people, do not be deceived. This thing that appears by Tanstafaal’s side is not our god. I too was fooled at first, but I have come to realize by her actions that she is an impostor. When she appeared to me the night before Garak died, she told me to kill all that lived under the mountains, even the dwarves who ended up helping us. Likewise when we escaped from the caves, she appeared to me again, and told me to bow down to the humans, else she would destroy me. Never has Eloh threatened one of us or dictated our actions."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "fighter_speaker",
            text: _("Why should we trust you? We have not heard Eloh’s words directly. Only now that you have led us into this folly has Eloh appeared to us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("She claims to be the one who has shepherded us during this journey, but who protected you across the harsh sands, who fought the orcs and led you under the mountains, who led you out again, against all odds? I did. I have bled for you, every step of the way. If you will not trust me based on my words, then trust me based on my actions. I have done the best I could for my people, and I stand by my actions. I believe that the merfolk are our friends, as the dwarves were. I refuse to bow down to harsh words and threats; we elves have always been free to make our own choices. We are not slaves, and will not blindly follow either humans or some false god."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_41",
        on: "branch_if_41",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "ally_race",
            not_equals: "dwarf",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Wait, my people, do not be deceived. This thing that appears by Tanstafaal’s side is not our god. I too was fooled at first, but I have come to realize by her actions that she is an impostor. When she appeared to me the night before Garak died, she told me to kill all that lived under the mountains, even the trolls who ended up helping us. Likewise when we escaped from the caves, she appeared to me again, and told me to bow down to the humans, else she would destroy me. Never has Eloh threatened one of us or dictated our actions."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "fighter_speaker",
            text: _("Why should we trust you? We have not heard these words directly. Only now that you have led us into this folly has she appeared to us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("She claims to be the one who has shepherded us during this journey, but who protected you across the harsh sands, who fought the orcs and led you under the mountains, who led you out again, against all odds? I did. I have bled for you, every step of the way. If you will not trust me based on my words, then trust me based on my actions. I have done the best I could for my people, and I stand by my actions. I believe that the merfolk are our friends, as the trolls were. I refuse to bow down to harsh words and threats; we elves have always been free to make our own choices. We are not slaves, and will not blindly follow either the humans or some false god."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_42",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: "$($turn_number+2)",
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "have_unit",
                id: "Eloh",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("I’m sorry Kaleh, I cannot let our people slaughter each other. There must be a way to stop this."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("No, don’t..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("I have no choice, goodbye."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:teleport",
            id: "Zhul",
            x: 52,
            y: 15,
            to_x: 51,
            to_y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Oh Eloh, you know how long I have faithfully served you. I ask you now a boon in return. Do not kill the boy Kaleh, he is just doing what his heart tells him to do. Did you not say, <i>“To err is elven, but to forgive divine”</i>?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("You dare to lecture me? I am a god and you are but a mortal. You of all people should know that your position is to enforce my will, not question it!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("But you yourself can see that many of our people’s faith is wavering. You cannot gain their loyalty by slaughtering the boy and his friends. Be merciful and kind, as you have always been, and there may be no need for this self-annihilating conflict."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("Times have changed. Mercy is a sign of weakness. Let this be a lesson to everyone, absolute loyalty is absolute strength. It is clear that you do not understand this concept, Zhul. My people, now is a time to tear down the old guard and create a new empire of strength, fealty and glory! I shall grant those who are loyal eternal life and we will triumph over all enemies!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("No, I—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("No, I don’t think you shall pester me any more. You shall be as a statue, forced to watch events unfold and helpless to interfere. Yes, I think this will be an appropriate punishment. Then perhaps you will learn not to question my divine will."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:petrify",
            id: "Zhul",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_43",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: "$($turn_number+5)",
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "have_unit",
                id: "Eloh",
              },
              {
                tag: "have_unit",
                id: "Kromph",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kromph",
            text: _("Aarrggh! Voices in my head, make them stop!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("What? What do you hear?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kromph",
            text: _("Must... Can’t... Must... Help me!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_45",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Eloh%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "have_unit",
                id: "Kromph",
                side: 3,
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kromph",
            text: _("Mistress gone, must follow commands, but Nym master too, Nym say must protect elves, but mistress say must kill elves, but must protect, must kill, protect, kill, protect, kill, augghh!!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Kromph",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("He just collapsed, the conflicting orders must have been too much for him."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Poor Kromph, at least he’s finally at rest."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_44",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: "$($turn_number+6)",
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "have_unit",
                id: "Eloh",
              },
              {
                tag: "have_unit",
                id: "Kromph",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kromph",
            text: _("Must obey... Can’t resist... I... Yes, Mistress, I am yours."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kromph",
            text: _("Pretty lady say elves bad. Kill elves. Kill!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            side: 3,
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Kromph%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Kromph",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_39",
        on: "eloh_appears",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_side",
            side: 1,
            gold: 0,
            income: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:clear_shroud",
            side: 1,
            xs: "50-54",
            ys: "13-16",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Tanstafaal",
            type: "Quenoth Champion",
            side: 3,
            x: 51,
            y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Tanstafaal",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tanstafaal",
            text: _("Hail, my brothers, I have returned!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Tanstafaal, where have you been? We have been looking for you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tanstafaal",
            text: _("I have gone on a journey and I have seen the light. No longer will I blindly follow in your footsteps, Kaleh. I have come back to lead our people on the true path. She has spoken to me, and I am but an implement of her divine will."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Who has spoken to you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Eloh",
            type: "Divine Avatar",
            side: 8,
            x: 52,
            y: 15,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Eloh",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to_unit",
            id: "Eloh",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tanstafaal",
            text: _("Behold, our goddess has returned to us. All bow down to Eloh, our savior!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "mystic_speaker",
            text: _("The Goddess!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "fighter_speaker",
            text: _("Forgive me my sins!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("That I am so blessed to gaze upon Eloh herself..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("Hail my people. In your time of trial I appear to you, to save you yet again."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("I come to you with dire news: one of you has betrayed me, and is a traitor to your cause."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "mystic_speaker",
            text: _("What?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "scout_speaker",
            text: _("No!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "rider_speaker",
            text: _("Who?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("Did I not say that I would deliver you from evil and bring you to the promised land? I have shepherded you out of the harsh deserts and under the mountains. And your salvation was almost at hand."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("But there was one who grew corrupted by his power and rejected my divine plan. He sought to usurp my authority. He had no faith and believed that he knew better than me, I who have watched over you for generations. He wanted to lead you astray. In these perilous lands, the fate of your journey stands upon the edge of a knife, falter once and all shall fail."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("Yes, I speak of your so-called leader, Kaleh. I did call out to him initially because I thought he was one of the faithful, but he betrayed my trust. The humans you are slaughtering wanted to help you, until Kaleh foolishly attacked them. And now Kaleh has you serving the evil merfolk and their insidious plans. Follow his path and he would have you bow down and serve the merfolk’s foul god."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("That is why I called out to Tanstafaal, one of my loyal followers. All is not yet lost. Follow him and I can still deliver you from your peril. But first, come back to me, stop fighting these humans, and kill this heretic Kaleh and his cronies."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_40",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_41",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tanstafaal",
            text: _("Your words are meaningless, Kaleh. My brethren, Eloh has appeared to you. She has spoken. Defy her at your own peril. I declare all who oppose Eloh heretics. All who are faithful, join me and let us kill the usurpers!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Eloh would never ask elf to kill elf. But it seems I have little choice. My people, I have led you this far, join with me and help me crush this new rebellion!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("I have followed you this far Kaleh, I will not abandon you now. But I admit that my faith is shaken. If that is not our god, then what is it?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("I do not know, but given what I have seen of the humans, I think following her would lead us down a dark road indeed. One that I personally do not want to discover the end of."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Forgive me, Kaleh. I do not know what to believe. I... I have to ponder this."),
          },
          {
            tag: "switch",
            variable: "ally_id",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Grog",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Grog",
                    text: _("Great Leader told Grog to serve you, and so Grog will still follow your command. But other elves must be out on a separate island. How will we cross deep water?"),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Nog",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Nog",
                    text: _("Great Leader told Nog to serve you, and so Nog will still follow your command. But other elves must be out on a separate island. How will we cross deep water?"),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Rogrimir",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Rogrimir",
                    text: _("The chieftain told me to serve you, and it will take more than this to shatter my confidence in you, lad. But those elves must be out on a different island, how will we cross the deep water?"),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Jarl",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Jarl",
                    text: _("The chieftain told me to serve you, and it will take more than this to shatter my confidence in you, lad. But those elves must be out on a different island, how will we cross the deep water?"),
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I believe that in this we can help. We are very grateful for all you have done for us Kaleh, and though we assure that we mean you no harm, you are right that actions speak louder than words. We are more familiar with the waters than you are, and we noticed that there are two shallow paths leading to the island where the other elves must be. We can show you these paths and help you across so that you may put down this rebellion."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Ww",
            cells: "35,22;36,22;36,23;36,24;36,25;37,23;38,21;38,22;38,23;38,24;39,20;39,21;39,22;40,23",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Wwr",
            cells: "35,23;37,22;39,23;40,22",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Ww",
            cells: "47,26;49,26;49,27;49,29;50,27;50,28;50,29;51,25;51,27;51,28;52,29",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Wwr",
            cells: "50,30;51,29;49,28;48,27;50,26",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Thank you, I’m sure you will be very useful in the shallow waters. All right people, I don’t want to kill any more than I have to. Too much blood has been spilled already. Knock ’em out, wound them, kill them only if you must. But we must stop Tanstafaal in his lunacy before he destroys us entirely."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("We who have fought by your side before will stand with you Kaleh, but many of our people are fleeing and joining Tanstafaal. I’m afraid that while you can recall past warriors, you won’t be able to recruit any new ones."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Then we will make do with those few that we have."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:teleport",
            id: "Tanstafaal",
            x: 50,
            y: 17,
            to_x: 49,
            to_y: 16,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_14",
            type: "Quenoth Fighter",
            side: 3,
            x: 47,
            y: 15,
          },
          {
