            side: 4,
            x: 7,
            y: 11,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_21",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_22",
            type: "Bone Shooter",
            side: 4,
            x: 13,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_22",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Gosh, just when things were starting to calm down."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Our people are scattered and exhausted, where will we go now Kaleh? Shall we retreat into the dunes?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Before I decide, I have just one question: How did you merfolk plan on bringing us to meet your leader, if she dwells far beneath the sea?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Actually we prefer to dwell in the shallow waters, where we may frolic in the great coral reefs under the sun and moon. But I digress, we realize that you people cannot swim like us, and I believe I may have a solution."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("The humans of the Iron Council dwell in a large island to the northwest; I was taken there several times for interrogation. It is a fearsome place, full of black rock and tall peaks, but in the center is a lagoon. In the lagoon, I saw several ships anchored, which we might be able to use to transport your people across the waves."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Across the waves?! We are a people of the desert, we know nothing of piloting such vessels! And I do not like the idea of putting my life at the mercy of some human-built ship."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("We have already gone to many strange places and survived. I trust the merfolk. If they believe that they can transport us safely across the waters, then I will put my life in their hands."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Wherever you go Kaleh, I will follow."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Very well. You have not led us astray so far, I will not leave you now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "switch",
            variable: "ally_id",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Grog",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Grog",
                    text: _("Grog scared of big water and bright sun, but Grog will not dishonor Great Leader. Great Leader say follow Kaleh, and Grog will do so."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Nog",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Nog",
                    text: _("Nog scared of big water and bright sun, but Nog will not dishonor Great Leader. Great Leader say follow Kaleh, and Nog will do so."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Rogrimir",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Rogrimir",
                    text: _("Ouch, being stuck between the water and the sun is a terrible place to be, but where you go I will follow."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Jarl",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Jarl",
                    text: _("Ouch, being stuck between the water and the sun is a terrible place to be, but where you go I will follow."),
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We have attacked the humans in the past, when their boats trespass in our waters, and so they fear us greatly. Their dark mages have cast protective spells upon their boats, preventing any of our kind from boarding them. I am afraid that we cannot capture the boats for you. We will, of course, help you hold off the humans. Later, once we escape, with your help I think we can dispel the protections, but for now you must seize them yourselves."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("There are four boats in the lagoon. Once you have captured each of the four then we can help you steer them out into the open water and to freedom. Then we can pilot them to shore, safely away from the humans, and load the rest of your people on board. But we will need all four boats to fit all of your remaining people."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Truly, there are not as many of us as there once were."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Though the cost be high, we do what we must. Come let us go capture those boats."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "capture_ships",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_side",
            side: 1,
            recruit: "$stored_side_1.recruit",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_side",
            side: 4,
            gold: 250,
            income: 30,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:capture_village",
            side: 4,
            cells: "7-18,9-17",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
